															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-astari" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4341052); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4341052&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606380111" alt="Dr Astari" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4341052)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-astari" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4341052); return false;" >Dr Astari</a></span> <span class="odate time_1536593136 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">10 Sep 2018 15:25</span>
														</div>
